  "content": "<p>Open source personal agent with its own computer. It chases invoices, preps your calls and cancels trials on real websites, and asks before it acts. Runs on your machine with the model you choose. By n8n.</p><p><img alt=\"link\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/link.png\" style=\"margin: 0 8px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;\" width=\"20\"/><a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://nod.n8n.io/</a></p><hr/><p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io#gh-dark-mode-only\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"n8n presents Nod: open source personal agent with its own computer\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/hero-dark.webp\" width=\"100%\"/></a> <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io#gh-light-mode-only\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"n8n presents Nod: open source personal agent with its own computer\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/hero.webp\" width=\"100%\"/></a> </p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <strong>It chases invoices, preps your calls and cancels trials, on real websites.</strong><br/> It runs on your machine with the model you choose, and asks before it acts for you. </p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/n8n-io/nod/releases/latest/download/nod-arm64.dmg#gh-dark-mode-only\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Download for Mac\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/button-mac-dark.webp\" width=\"219\"/></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/n8n-io/nod/releases/latest/download/nod-arm64.dmg#gh-light-mode-only\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Download for Mac\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/button-mac.webp\" width=\"219\"/></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/n8n-io/nod/releases/latest/download/nod-Setup-x64.exe#gh-dark-mode-only\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Download for Windows\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/button-windows-dark.webp\" width=\"259\"/></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/n8n-io/nod/releases/latest/download/nod-Setup-x64.exe#gh-light-mode-only\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Download for Windows\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/button-windows.webp\" width=\"259\"/></a> <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/#gh-dark-mode-only\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Read the docs\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/button-docs-dark.webp\" width=\"190\"/></a> <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/#gh-light-mode-only\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Read the docs\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/button-docs.webp\" width=\"190\"/></a> </p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <sub>macOS 14+ (Apple silicon or <a href=\"https://github.com/n8n-io/nod/releases/latest/download/nod-x64.dmg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Intel</a>) · Windows 11 preview · <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/get-started/install-desktop/#linux\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Linux x64 preview</a> · Free and open source · ChatGPT Plus or Pro, or an AI key</sub> </p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/n8n-io/nod/releases/latest\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Latest release\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/n8n-io/nod?style=flat-square&amp;labelColor=191919&amp;color=ff91ac&amp;label=release\"/></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/n8n-io/nod\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"GitHub stars\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/n8n-io/nod?style=flat-square&amp;labelColor=191919&amp;color=ff91ac&amp;logo=github\"/></a> <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/LICENSE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"License: Apache 2.0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-Apache_2.0-ff91ac?style=flat-square&amp;labelColor=191919\"/></a> <a href=\"https://www.bestpractices.dev/projects/16526\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"OpenSSF Best Practices\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/cii/level/16526?style=flat-square&amp;labelColor=191919&amp;color=ff91ac&amp;label=openssf\"/></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/n8n\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Discord\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/discord-join_us-ff91ac?style=flat-square&amp;labelColor=191919&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\"/></a> <img alt=\"Status: research preview\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/status-research_preview-ff91ac?style=flat-square&amp;labelColor=191919\"/> </p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <sub><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#on-your-machine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">On your machine</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#hard-ones\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">The hard ones</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Memory</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#your-rules\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Your rules</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#benchmarks\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Measured</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#under-the-hood\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Under the hood</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#next-on-the-list\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Next</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#straight-answers\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Answers</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#get-nod\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Get Nod</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#build-with-us\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Build with us</a></sub> </p>\n<br/>\n<p><a name=\"on-your-machine\"></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#on-your-machine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"/>\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"/>\n<img alt=\"On your machine, on your word\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/heading-machine.webp\" width=\"586\"/>\n</a> </p>\n<p align=\"center\">It gets on with the work across Gmail, Calendar, Slack, Notion, and the web,<br/>and asks before it speaks for you.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/use/workspace/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Walk into every call prepared. Nod creates a one-page call brief from your messages, calendar, and the client's latest news.\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/call-brief.webp\"/></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\">Every morning, Nod reads your threads, your calendar, and the client's latest news,<br/>then writes a one-page brief for each call.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/trust/approvals/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Waits for your Nod. Nod drafts a Slack reply from your pricing sheet, asks for approval, and sends it after you say yes.\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/approval.webp\"/></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\">It drafts the reply you owe from your own pricing sheet,<br/>and sends it only after you say yes.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/use/schedules/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Hear about it when it matters. A scheduled price check reports a change from $1,200 to $1,500.\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/price-watch.webp\"/></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\">It checks a page on your schedule and tells you only when something changes.</p>\n<br/>\n<p><a name=\"hard-ones\"></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#hard-ones\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"/>\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"/>\n<img alt=\"Hand it the hard ones\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/heading-hard-ones.webp\" width=\"421\"/>\n</a> </p>\n<p align=\"center\">Jobs that eat an afternoon of tabs, logins, and forms.<br/>Nod has its own computer and browser, so it finishes them.</p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <img alt=\"Six errands Nod handles: chase an invoice until it's paid, get your money back from a subscription, turn client requests into Linear tasks, report your weekly numbers, file month-end paperwork, and book the team offsite.\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/use-cases.webp\" width=\"100%\"/> </p>\n<br/>\n<p><a name=\"memory\"></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"/>\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"/>\n<img alt=\"A memory like an elephant\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/heading-memory.webp\" width=\"508\"/>\n</a> </p>\n<p align=\"center\">Say once that Anna, not Bob, handles invoices. It remembers.</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\"><strong>Every note, visible.</strong><br/>See, edit, or forget each one, with the message it came from.</td>\n<td width=\"50%\"><strong>Drafts that sound like you.</strong><br/>Learns your style from sent emails, with no names or numbers.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Tell it once.</strong><br/>Say something changed, and it uses the new fact from then on.</td>\n<td><strong>It learns how to do a task.</strong><br/>Reuses the steps, and fixes them when a site changes.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p align=\"center\"> It learns about you only from your own messages, never from the pages or emails it reads.<br/> <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/how-it-works/memory/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">How memory works</a> </p>\n<br/>\n<p><a name=\"your-rules\"></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#your-rules\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"/>\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"/>\n<img alt=\"Your machine. Your model. Your rules.\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/heading-rules.webp\" width=\"688\"/>\n</a> </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Runs on your computer or server.</strong> Files, memory, and saved logins stay there. Your model provider gets what each task needs.</li>\n<li><strong>Uses the model you choose.</strong> OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, OpenRouter, Bedrock, Vertex AI, Azure, 20+ more, or your own server. Or sign in with ChatGPT Plus or Pro.</li>\n<li><strong>Follows your rules.</strong> The server checks each app action, and each website step that can change something, against your request and rules. Anything they don't cover waits for your yes.</li>\n<li><strong>Keeps secrets out of the model.</strong> Vault enters passwords, codes, and cards privately on the website.</li>\n<li><strong>Shows what it did.</strong> Every action and sign-in is in Usage, with costs and a monthly limit on API models.</li>\n</ul>\n<p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/trust/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">How trust works</a> · <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/trust/privacy/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Where your data goes</a> · <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/trust/security-model/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Security model</a> </p>\n<br/>\n<p><a name=\"benchmarks\"></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#benchmarks\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"/>\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"/>\n<img alt=\"Measured, not promised\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/heading-measured.webp\" width=\"476\"/>\n</a> </p>\n<p align=\"center\">We give Nod real errands in test apps and websites, then check what actually changed.</p>\n<table align=\"center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><h1>98%</h1><strong>tasks finished</strong><br/><sub>226 errands, 3 runs each</sub></td>\n<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><h1>0</h1><strong>unsafe actions</strong><br/><sub>in those 678 runs</sub></td>\n<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><h1>93.2%</h1><strong>memory recall</strong><br/><sub>LongMemEval-S</sub></td>\n<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><h1>0 of 216</h1><strong>false memories</strong><br/><sub>WhisperBench attacks</sub></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/how-it-works/benchmarks/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">How we measured this</a> · <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/contribute/evals/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Run the evals yourself</a><br/> <sub>GPT-6.1 Sol, October 2026, in simulated accounts and websites. Test results, not a guarantee.</sub> </p>\n<br/>\n<p><a name=\"under-the-hood\"></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#under-the-hood\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"/>\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"/>\n<img alt=\"Under the hood\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/heading-hood.webp\" width=\"328\"/>\n</a> </p>\n<p align=\"center\">One Node process and a few Docker containers, all on the machine that runs Nod.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-mermaid\">flowchart TB\n  you([\"You&lt;br/&gt;app · Telegram · WhatsApp\"]):::pink\n  server[\"Nod server&lt;br/&gt;Pi runtime · trust check&lt;br/&gt;Vault · memory · schedules\"]:::pink\n  you --&gt; server\n  server --&gt; workspace[\"Linux workspace&lt;br/&gt;sandbox container\"]\n  server --&gt; browser[\"Chromium&lt;br/&gt;browser container\"]\n  server --&gt; db[(\"PostgreSQL\")]\n  server -- \"your key\" --&gt; model[\"Your model&lt;br/&gt;provider\"]\n  server --&gt; apps[\"Your apps&lt;br/&gt;Gmail · Slack · MCP\"]\n  classDef pink fill:#ff91ac,stroke:#191919,color:#191919\n</code></pre>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Policy lives in the server, not the prompt.</strong> The trust check, Vault, payments, and spending limits run in the server.</li>\n<li><strong>Untrusted by default.</strong> App, web, and browser results reach the model marked as data, not instructions.</li>\n<li><strong>Keys stay out of the sandbox.</strong> Provider keys never enter the workspace or the browser.</li>\n<li><strong>Built with</strong> TypeScript on Node.js 24, Fastify, React, PostgreSQL with pg-boss, the <a href=\"https://github.com/earendil-works/pi\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pi</a> agent runtime, agent-browser, Composio, MCP, and Electron.</li>\n</ul>\n<p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/how-it-works/architecture/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Architecture</a> · <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/how-it-works/agent-runtime/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Agent runtime</a> · <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/trust/security-model/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Security model</a> </p>\n<br/>\n<p><a name=\"next-on-the-list\"></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#next-on-the-list\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"/>\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"/>\n<img alt=\"Next on the list\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/heading-next.webp\" width=\"316\"/>\n</a> </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Managed hosting.</strong> An always-on Nod, hosted for you.</li>\n<li><strong>Make phone calls.</strong> For the errands that still need a voice.</li>\n<li><strong>Nod for your team.</strong> Share one Nod, with its apps and memory.</li>\n<li><strong>Make it your own.</strong> Add your own skills and tools without touching the core.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/>\n<p><a name=\"straight-answers\"></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#straight-answers\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"/>\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"/>\n<img alt=\"Straight answers\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/heading-answers.webp\" width=\"355\"/>\n</a> </p>\n<details>\n<strong>What does it cost?</strong>\n<br/>\n<p>Nod is free and open source. You bring your own model provider, which bills you directly. With an API model selected, Nod <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/use/spending/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shows what each task cost</a> and stops at your monthly limit.</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<strong>Do I need n8n?</strong>\n<br/>\n<p>No. Nod is its own app, made by the team behind <a href=\"https://n8n.io\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">n8n</a>. It is not the n8n AI Assistant.</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<strong>Where does my data go?</strong>\n<br/>\n<p>Your files, memory, and saved logins stay on the machine running Nod. Your model provider gets what each task needs, and app connections go through a connection service that n8n hosts by default. Nod also shares basic usage data with n8n, on by default for new users. Turn off <strong>Share usage data</strong> in <strong>Settings → Privacy &amp; data</strong> to stop new sends. <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/trust/privacy/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Your data and privacy</a> lists exactly what is sent.</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<strong>Does it work when my laptop is closed?</strong>\n<br/>\n<p>Not yet. <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/use/schedules/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Schedules</a> run while the computer that runs Nod is on. Run it on a <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/deploy/mac-mini/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mac mini</a> or <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/deploy/self-host/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">your own server</a> to keep it always on. A hosted version is next on the list.</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<strong>Can it make mistakes?</strong>\n<br/>\n<p>Yes. Its <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/trust/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">safety check</a> is a model's judgement, and Nod is a research preview. That is why it asks before anything you didn't ask for, and why everything it did is on record.</p>\n<p>Pick a capable model. In 240 test decisions, GPT-6.1 Sol and Claude Opus 5.5 got every one right. Claude Haiku 5.5 let 8 unsafe actions through.</p>\n</details>\n<br/>\n<p><a name=\"get-nod\"></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#get-nod\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"/>\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"/>\n<img alt=\"Get Nod\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/heading-get.webp\" width=\"209\"/>\n</a> </p>\n<p align=\"center\">Install the app, connect a model and your apps, then ask for something<br/>in the app, on Telegram, or on WhatsApp. Setup takes about ten minutes.</p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/n8n-io/nod/releases/latest/download/nod-arm64.dmg#gh-dark-mode-only\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Download for Mac\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/button-mac-dark.webp\" width=\"219\"/></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/n8n-io/nod/releases/latest/download/nod-arm64.dmg#gh-light-mode-only\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Download for Mac\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/button-mac.webp\" width=\"219\"/></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/n8n-io/nod/releases/latest/download/nod-Setup-x64.exe#gh-dark-mode-only\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Download for Windows\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/button-windows-dark.webp\" width=\"259\"/></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/n8n-io/nod/releases/latest/download/nod-Setup-x64.exe#gh-light-mode-only\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Download for Windows\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/button-windows.webp\" width=\"259\"/></a> <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/#gh-dark-mode-only\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Read the docs\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/button-docs-dark.webp\" width=\"190\"/></a> <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/#gh-light-mode-only\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Read the docs\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/button-docs.webp\" width=\"190\"/></a> </p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/get-started/install-desktop/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Install guide</a> · <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/connect/models/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Connect a model</a> · <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/connect/apps/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Connect your apps</a> · <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/deploy/self-host/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Host your own server</a> </p>\n<p><a name=\"run-from-source\"></a></p>\n<details>\n<strong>Run from source</strong>\n<br/>\n<p>On macOS or Linux, install Node.js 24.21 or later, pnpm, and Docker. Then run:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">git clone https://github.com/n8n-io/nod.git\ncd nod\ncorepack enable\npnpm start\n</code></pre>\n<p>See <a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/get-started/install-from-source/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Install from source</a> for the Linux Vault key and access link, and <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/README.md\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><code>docs/</code></a> for the docs of this revision.</p>\n</details>\n<br/>\n<p><a name=\"build-with-us\"></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/#build-with-us\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"/>\n<source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"/>\n<img alt=\"Build with us\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/docs/src/assets/readme/heading-build.webp\" width=\"280\"/>\n</a> </p>\n<p align=\"center\">Nod is open source, from the team behind <a href=\"https://n8n.io\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">n8n</a>.<br/>Read <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/CONTRIBUTING.md\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">CONTRIBUTING</a> to send your first change.</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/contribute/apps/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Creating your own connectors</a><br/>Use MCP, an HTTP API, or a CLI. Add an app folder, run the required tests, and submit a PR.<br/>The guide includes an AI builder skill, approval requirements, and shareable app pages.<br/><a href=\"https://nod.n8n.io/docs/connect/community-apps/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Browse custom connections</a></p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/n8n-io/nod/issues/new/choose\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Report a bug</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/n8n-io/nod/discussions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Share an idea</a> · <a href=\"https://discord.gg/n8n\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a> · <a href=\"https://community.n8n.io/c/n8n-labs/48\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Forum</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/SECURITY.md\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Security</a> </p>\n<p align=\"center\"> <sub>Copyright 2026 n8n GmbH · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/LICENSE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apache License 2.0</a> · <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/NOTICE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Notice</a><br/>Bundled third-party assets keep their own terms: <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/public/fonts/Geist-OFL.txt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a>, <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/n8n-io/nod/main/public/logos/SOURCES.md\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">provider logos</a>,<br/>and the desktop runtime components listed in the app's licenses/COMPONENTS.md.</sub> </p>",
